NOTE:PROFESSIONAL PROFILE\n\nCurrent Role:\nManaging Director of Chipkins Puratos\, leading South Africa's largest bakery ingredients distributor.\n\nDirect Reports (Executive Committee):\n- Lowell Harkoo (Marketing Exec - Sales & Marketing)\n- Rodney Nel (Finance Exec)\n- Remi Piot (Innovations Exec - R&D)\n- Malibongwe Shelle (Operations Exec - Production\, Warehousing\, Distribution)\n- Nomsa Kganakga (HR Exec)\n- Silindile Mpungose (Procurement Exec)\n\nOther Key Reports:\n- David Magrobi (Technical Manager Plants)\n- Tahlia Elcome (Solutions Architect)\n- Carl Van Der Velden (Business Controller)\n\nKey Achievements:\n- Led Bakery School South Africa initiative (launched 2019) in partnership with Bakery School Foundation\n- 72 students graduated since programme inception\n- Championed skills development and youth employment in bakery industry\n- Key figure in Puratos-Bidcorp joint venture formation\n\nPublic Statements:\nOn Bakery School: "In South Africa we are proud to have embarked on the bakery school project which allows us to help young people who come from an under privileged background get a great platform for a successful career in our industry."\n\nOn Joint Venture: "This augurs well for strong future sales growth\, especially in market segments of the baking industry where BBS traditionally was underrepresented."\n\nSources:\n- https://www.chipkinspuratos.co.za/za/news/chipkins-puratos-bakery-school-sa\n- https://www.bakeryschoolfoundation.com/school/bakery-school-south-africa/\n- https://www.puratos.com/press/press-release/agreement-with-bidcorp-foods-bakery-solutions-division
